## The following text has been annotated for parts of speech by students at NTU Singapore as part of a class project in AY 2025.
## Verses are extracted from the taggedPBC. Annotations have been developed with a combination of manual and automated approaches, with reference to existing literature and (where possible) native speakers.
## ISO 639-3: enm, Language: Middle English, Number of verses: 1885
## References: Blake, N. (Ed.). (1992). The cambridge history of the english language: Volume 2: 1066–1476 (Vol. 2). Cambridge University Press. https://doi.org/10.1017/CHOL9780521264754 ; Hogg, R., & Denison, D. (Eds.). (2006). A history of the english language (1st ed.). Cambridge University Press. https://doi.org/10.1017/CBO9780511791154

